! mcp_bootstrap_p411.strap -- MCP printed page 411: the $EOJ program's
! reassembly of "A PRINT SUB - ROUTINE THAT WILL PRINT ASSIGNMENTS" --
! its data: message buffers, three hex constants, five index SYNs, four
! one-bit flags and three index words (T BUF01 .. T PSAV).
!
! docs/MCP_Mar63_250-445.pdf PDF p.161, read at 400 dpi.  Header, READ:
! "TIME CLOCK 00054041  PUNID 22$EOJ  CARD ID ZE000665  DIST. OF 3/01
!  3/01  PAGE NUMBER 411"; the heading row's LOCATION field is BLANK
! (lines 1-7 are remarks).  The Vision geometry of this page is missing
! (v2_pdf161.geom is "none"), so tools/page_sheet.py 411 gives nothing;
! every value is read off the image alone.
!
! >>> STILL $EOJ, card series ZE, low core 0217xx.  No SLC is printed;
! the SLC below is scaffolding for line 9's printed location.  Line 8's
! CNOP prints no location and no binary: the counter already stood on
! a word boundary.  No TAIL.
!
! THE PAGE.  37 lines, every line number prints a "*"; a "*" after the
! LOCATION on lines 9, 14 and 24.  Contiguous 021726.00 .. 021762.00
! (line 37, an XW; next 021763.00), then blank paper.
!   lines  1-7   remark banner (line 3 is the title).
!   lines  8-24  CNOPs, (IQSX)/(A*) character data, three DD(BU),(16)
!                constants (binary printed, checked).
!   lines 26-30  T XA .. T IXY SYN,$2..$6, print 0000nn.00+ +00000000
!                BU,100,10 -- SYN rows, no !CHECK (they compile nothing).
!   lines 31-34  four DD(BU,1) flags 021757.00-.03.
!   lines 35-37  three XWs.
! The same source as the volume-1 bootstrap's printed p.76 (decks/
! mcp_bootstrap_p76.strap, at 004423.40-004460), every label at the same
! relative offset (+15302 octal) -- but this card set terminates the
! (IQS) messages with "X" ((IQSX)), not "*".  Spellings only were taken
! from p.76; addresses and lengths are this page's.
!
! THE ENTRY-MODE BLANKS.  Every message's length is fixed by the next
! printed LOCATION (lines 9-10, 12-17, 20-22; line 24 by line 31's
! 021757.00).  The split of blanks was MEASURED at 400 dpi against the
! character pitch (40.2 px): line 9 two leading / four trailing; line 12
! one leading, one trailing; line 14 one/one; line 16 one/one; line 20
! none leading ("SCRATCH" against the comma), one trailing; line 21 one
! leading, one trailing; line 24 one leading.  The same as p.76.
!
! GLYPHS SETTLED BY OTHER THAN PLAIN INK:
!   * line 18 "(16)00171D8315008B8F": the D prints worn (C-like), the
!     zeros open.  Printed binary 0000270730142500105617 = 0x00171D83
!     15008B8F exactly; a C would print ...0270716... .
!   * lines 11 and 19: zeros print open ("C") in the hex literals; the
!     printed binaries 0000174733321303310621 and 1046230521062300000000
!     are 0x000F9DB68B0D9191 and 0x8993151193000000.
!   * line 36 "T P5CUT" = TP5OUT (open O; p.76's spelling).  Line 33's
!     remark "CVERLAP" written OVERLAP.
!   * T BUF01 (line 9): digit 0 as p.76 spells it.
!
! CARD SERIALS.  ZE000665 .. ZE000701, one per line, consecutive.
! (p.409 ended at ZE000609; p.410 not seen.)
!
! No externals: the page defines every symbol it uses.

        SLC, (8)021726.0
! line  1  -
! line  2  - ------------------------------------------------------------------------
! line  3  -                    A PRINT SUB - ROUTINE THAT WILL PRINT ASSIGNMENTS
! line  4  - ------------------------------------------------------------------------
! line  5  -
! line  6  -
! line  7  -
        CNOP                                                 ! line  8
TBUF01  (IQSX)DD(BU,64,8),  --- SET UP THE FOLLOWING UNITS ---    X ! line  9
TMBLK   (IQSX)DD(BU,64,8),        X                          ! line 10  -BLANK MASK
TBUFB1  DD(BU),(16)000F9DB68B0D9191                          ! line 11  -BYPASS IN RED
        (IQSX)DD(BU), MOUNT - REEL NUMBER X                  ! line 12
TREELX  (IQSX)DD(BU,64,8),        X                          ! line 13
        (IQSX)DD(BU,64,8), ON CHANNEL X                      ! line 14
TCHANX  (IQSX)DD(BU,24,8),   X                               ! line 15
        (IQSX)DD(BU,36,8), UNIT X                            ! line 16
TUNITX  (IQSX)DD(BU),      X                                 ! line 17
        DD(BU),(16)00171D8315008B8F                          ! line 18
        DD(BU),(16)8993151193000000                          ! line 19
TSCRAT  (IQSX)DD(BU,64,8),SCRATCH X                          ! line 20
TSUBHD  (IQSX)DD(BU,8,8), -- PROBLEM PROGRAM --- X           ! line 21
TPID    (IQSX)DD(BU,64,8),        X                          ! line 22
        CNOP                                                 ! line 23
TMESSY  (A*)DD(BU), I/O REQ. INCOMP WITH MACH CONF.*         ! line 24
! line 25  -
TXA     SYN,$2                                               ! line 26
TXB     SYN,$3                                               ! line 27
TXC     SYN,$4                                               ! line 28
TIXZ    SYN,$5                                               ! line 29
TIXY    SYN,$6                                               ! line 30  -
THEAD   DD(BU,1),0                                           ! line 31
TSBHDI  DD(BU,1),0                                           ! line 32  -SUB HEADING IND
TNGATE  DD(BU,1),0                                           ! line 33  -GATE FOR NOT OVERLAP RE-ITERATION
YSCRBT  DD(BU,1),(2)0                                        ! line 34
TP5IN   XW                                                   ! line 35  -CONVERSION BUFFER IN
TP5OUT  XW                                                   ! line 36  -CONVERSION BUFFER OUT
TPSAV   XW                                                   ! line 37  -CONVERSION BUFFER INDEX SAVE

!SYM TBUF01 021726.00
!SYM TMBLK  021733.00
!SYM TBUFB1 021734.00
!SYM TREELX 021737.50
!SYM TCHANX 021742.10
!SYM TUNITX 021743.20
!SYM TSCRAT 021746.00
!SYM TSUBHD 021747.00
!SYM TPID   021752.00
!SYM TMESSY 021753.00
!SYM TXA    000022.00
!SYM TXB    000023.00
!SYM TXC    000024.00
!SYM TIXZ   000025.00
!SYM TIXY   000026.00
!SYM THEAD  021757.00
!SYM TSBHDI 021757.01
!SYM TNGATE 021757.02
!SYM YSCRBT 021757.03
!SYM TP5IN  021760.00
!SYM TP5OUT 021761.00
!SYM TPSAV  021762.00
!CHECK 021734.00 | 0000174733321303310621 | line 11 T BUFB1 DD(BU),(16)000F9DB68B0D9191 (zeros print open) | 64
!CHECK 021744.00 | 0000270730142500105617 | line 18 DD(BU),(16)00171D8315008B8F (D prints worn) | 64
!CHECK 021745.00 | 1046230521062300000000 | line 19 DD(BU),(16)8993151193000000 (zeros print open) | 64
!CHECK 021757.00 | 0 | line 31 T HEAD DD(BU,1),0 | 1
!CHECK 021757.01 | 0 | line 32 T SBHDI DD(BU,1),0 | 1
!CHECK 021757.02 | 0 | line 33 T NGATE DD(BU,1),0 | 1
!CHECK 021757.03 | 0 | line 34 YSCRBT DD(BU,1),(2)0 | 1
!CHECK 021760.00 | 000000.00+ 000 000000 000000 | line 35 T P5IN XW
!CHECK 021761.00 | 000000.00+ 000 000000 000000 | line 36 T P5OUT XW (prints "CC0000.00+ CC0 ... CCCCCC": open 0)
!CHECK 021762.00 | 000000.00+ 000 000000 000000 | line 37 T PSAV XW
